OL,3,AAmerican ranchers wrestle with soaring
OL,4,Acosts - and their loyalty to Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FNebraska rancher Yvette Mannon was
OL,7,Falready having a rough year.
OL,9,FIn April, a wildfire destroyed 1,600
OL,10,Fgrazing acres and 13 miles (21 km) of
OL,11,Ffence along the ranch she bought in
OL,12,F2002. The ranch is nestled in a corner
OL,13,Fof Nebraska that's home to rolling
OL,14,Fgreen hills under sweeping Midwestern
OL,15,Fskies, the landscape dotted with grain
OL,16,Fsilos and feedlots alongside fields and
OL,17,Ffields of bovines.
OL,19,FMannon's 300 cattle survived the blaze
OL,20,F- but the fencing needed to be
OL,21,Freplaced, and the herd still needed to
OL,22,Fbe fed.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
