OL,3,AAmerican ranchers wrestle with soaring
OL,4,Acosts - and their loyalty to Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith steel prices at their highest
OL,7,Flevels in years, heavily affected by
OL,8,Ftariffs imposed by US President Donald
OL,9,FTrump, that meant spending $4.89 a foot
OL,10,F- for a total exceeding $300,000.
